>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Updated November 2026"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Cinnamon Protein Powder</Fragment>
      Which cinnamon powders use real cinnamon, why cassia and Ceylon are not the same thing, and how much coumarin a daily cinnamon shake can carry.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#real-cinnamon-vs-flavoring">Real Cinnamon vs Flavoring</a>
      <a href="#cassia-vs-ceylon">Cassia vs Ceylon</a>
      <a href="#coumarin-per-scoop">Coumarin per Scoop</a>
