      <a href="#buying-on-amazon">Buying on Amazon</a>
      <a href="#how-we-picked">How We Picked</a>
      <a href="#mistakes">Common Mistakes</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </TableOfContents>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 lg:pb-24">
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="lede">
          The best cinnamon protein powder for most people is Ghost Whey in Cinnabon, because it gives 25 g of protein in about 130 calories and lists real cinnamon rather than flavoring alone. That cinnamon is cassia, which is fine in the small amount in a scoop. If you drink a cinnamon shake daily or add your own spice, choose Ceylon: Truvani's Banana Cinnamon is the only ready-made pick we found that names it, and a vanilla isolate plus your own Ceylon gives you full control.
        </p>

        <QuickPicks products={PRODUCTS} />

        <div id="quick-comparison" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            1. Quick Comparison: The Best Cinnamon Protein Powders
          </h2>

