            The short version: Ghost Whey Cinnabon is the best cinnamon protein powder for most people, because it tastes like a cinnamon roll, gives 25 g of protein in about 130 calories and lists real cinnamon rather than only flavoring. That cinnamon is cassia-type, which is fine at the small amount in a scoop. If you plan to drink a cinnamon shake every day and want Ceylon, Truvani's Banana Cinnamon is the only ready-made option we found that names Ceylon on the label. Quest Cinnamon Crunch is the low-carb pick, and a vanilla isolate plus your own Ceylon is the most controllable.
          </p>

