          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Most cinnamon protein powder is either cassia or flavoring, and both are fine in the amount a single scoop holds. Ghost Cinnabon is the best-tasting cinnamon whey with real spice, Truvani is the Ceylon pick, and Quest is the low-carb option for shakes and baking.
          </p>
